"""Rule metadata for the SARIF renderer, generated from docs/RULES.md.

Each entry: the rule's documented severity and its trigger text from
the Rule Reference. Generated from the v0.6 RULES.md; the test suite
(run_tests.py) re-parses docs/RULES.md and fails if this table and
the document disagree, so the two cannot drift silently.
"""

